fizz_buzz_sum that adds up all numbers below target that are divisible by 3 or 5 (counting numbers like 15 only once):
def fizz_buzz_sum(target):
  total=0
  for x in range(target):
    if x%3==0 or x%5==0:
      total +=x 
  return total

